ferrum (0.1.2-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * SMB: fix credential prompt loop for shares added in the current session.
  * SMB: persist the username entered in the credential dialog.
  * SMB: treat STATUS_LOGON_FAILURE / ACCESS_DENIED as auth failures so the
    credential dialog re-opens instead of a generic connection error.
  * SMB: prefer the typed password over a stale keyring entry; never strip
    passwords.
  * Packaging: build the .deb directly from the hatchling wheel; clean dist/.

